okf_version: "1.0"
task: "Diagnosing the red test_posix_installer_reads_assets_from_its_own_directory while running the unit group inside a live ciel-runtime session."
finding: "install.sh resolved SHARE_DIR from the inherited CIEL_RUNTIME_HOME and overwrote the pinned snapshot install directory instead of installing to $PREFIX. Proven by running the suite inside this session: the file landed in C:\\Users\\djlov\\.local\\share\\ciel-runtime-984e05fa079737f17ffef67bab6068fce47c15d3 (hash of the session's own install), not in $PREFIX/share/ciel-runtime."
mechanism: "The snapshot guard compares ${RUNTIME_HOME##*/} against ciel-runtime-[0-9a-f]{7}. On Windows paths (backslash separators) '##*/' splits nothing, so the pattern never matched: sh -c 'RUNTIME_HOME=C:\\...\\ciel-runtime-984e05f...; ${RUNTIME_HOME##*/}' returns the whole path and the case statement reports NOMATCH (reproduced 2026-09-18). install.ps1 uses Split-Path -Leaf and was unaffected."
consequence: "Two-fold: (1) the test asserted $PREFIX and failed, so the suite was red for a real reason; (2) every such install (test or manual) rewrote the live 984e05f snapshot with whatever working tree ran it, breaking the invariant that a snapshot directory name matches its content."
damage_and_restore: "This session's manual install.sh run (PREFIX=/tmp/... sh install.sh) did overwrite it: ciel_runtime_support/providers/deepseek.py carried the HEAD content (0cc81b83...) instead of the 984e05f content (653bb544...). Restored by running install.sh from a git worktree at 984e05f with CIEL_RUNTIME_INSTALL_HOME pointing at that directory; diff -rq --exclude=__pycache__ against the 984e05f tree is now empty and ciel_runtime.py hashes match (0f8a2ecc...). No bin scripts were touched (PREFIX pointed at a temp directory)."
fix: "install.sh strips the last backslash before matching: RUNTIME_HOME_BASE=${RUNTIME_HOME##*/}; RUNTIME_HOME_BASE=${RUNTIME_HOME_BASE##*\\\\}; case \"$RUNTIME_HOME_BASE\" in ... A POSIX path is unaffected (no backslash to strip)."
verification: "test_install_script_paths 4/4 OK; unit group 1487 OK; the live 984e05f directory still hashes to the 984e05f content after the suite runs."
state: "Working tree."
